  "content": "\n\n<p>允許資源包新增連接紋理、發光渲染等功能。可在此處找到為原版及部分指定模組套用這些效果的資源包：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ctp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需更多資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Chisel-Team/ConnectedTexturesMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>CTM 現在有了 <a href=\"http://discord.gg/0vVjLvWg5kyQwnHG\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>！&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組為 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/chisel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel</a> 的依賴模組。</p>",
